  87:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****       
  88:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****         (++) For STM32F30x/STM32F33x devices:
  89:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****              Two possible clock sources: synchronous clock derived from AHB clock 
  90:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****              or asynchronous clock derived from ADC dedicated PLL 72MHz.
  91:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****               - Synchronous clock is mandatory since used as ADC core clock.
  92:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****                 Synchronous clock can be used optionally as ADC conversion clock, depending on ADC 
  93:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****                 Synchronous clock is configured using macro __ADCx_CLK_ENABLE().
  94:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****               - Asynchronous can be used optionally as ADC conversion clock, depending on ADC init 
  95:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****                 Asynchronous clock is configured using function HAL_RCCEx_PeriphCLKConfig().
  96:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****              (+++) For example, in case of device with a single ADC:
  97:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****                    Into HAL_ADC_MspInit() (recommended code location) or with
  98:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****                    other device clock parameters configuration:
  99:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****                (+++) __HAL_RCC_ADC1_CLK_ENABLE()                            (mandatory)
 100:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****                (+++) PeriphClkInit.PeriphClockSelection = RCC_PERIPHCLK_ADC (optional, if ADC conve
 101:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****                (+++) PeriphClkInit.Adc1ClockSelection = RCC_ADC1PLLCLK_DIV1 (optional, if ADC conve
 102:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****                (+++) HAL_RCCEx_PeriphCLKConfig(&RCC_PeriphClkInitStructure) (optional, if ADC conve
 103:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c **** 
 104:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****              (+++) For example, in case of device with 4 ADCs:
