 130:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****     (#) ADC pins configuration
 131:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****          (++) Enable the clock for the ADC GPIOs
 132:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****               using macro __HAL_RCC_GPIOx_CLK_ENABLE()
 133:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****          (++) Configure these ADC pins in analog mode
 134:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****               using function HAL_GPIO_Init()
 135:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c **** 
 136:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****     (#) Optionally, in case of usage of ADC with interruptions:
 137:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****          (++) Configure the NVIC for ADC
 138:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****               using function HAL_NVIC_EnableIRQ(ADCx_IRQn)
