 321:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****     *** Callback registration ***
 322:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****     =============================================
 323:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****     [..]
 324:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c **** 
 325:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****      The compilation flag USE_HAL_ADC_REGISTER_CALLBACKS, when set to 1,
 326:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****      allows the user to configure dynamically the driver callbacks.
 327:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****      Use Functions HAL_ADC_RegisterCallback()
 328:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****      to register an interrupt callback.
 329:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****     [..]
 330:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c **** 
 331:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****      Function HAL_ADC_RegisterCallback() allows to register following callbacks:
 332:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****        (+) ConvCpltCallback               : ADC conversion complete callback
 333:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****        (+) ConvHalfCpltCallback           : ADC conversion DMA half-transfer callback
 334:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****        (+) LevelOutOfWindowCallback       : ADC analog watchdog 1 callback
 335:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****        (+) ErrorCallback                  : ADC error callback
 336:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****        (+) InjectedConvCpltCallback       : ADC group injected conversion complete callback
 337:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****        (+) MspInitCallback                : ADC Msp Init callback
 338:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****        (+) MspDeInitCallback              : ADC Msp DeInit callback
 339:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****      This function takes as parameters the HAL peripheral handle, the Callback ID
 340:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****      and a pointer to the user callback function.
 341:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****     [..]
 342:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c **** 
 343:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****      Use function HAL_ADC_UnRegisterCallback to reset a callback to the default
 344:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****      weak function.
 345:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****     [..]
 346:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c **** 
 347:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****      HAL_ADC_UnRegisterCallback takes as parameters the HAL peripheral handle,
 348:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****      and the Callback ID.
 349:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****      This function allows to reset following callbacks:
 350:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****        (+) ConvCpltCallback               : ADC conversion complete callback
 351:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****        (+) ConvHalfCpltCallback           : ADC conversion DMA half-transfer callback
 352:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****        (+) LevelOutOfWindowCallback       : ADC analog watchdog 1 callback
 353:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****        (+) ErrorCallback                  : ADC error callback
 354:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****        (+) InjectedConvCpltCallback       : ADC group injected conversion complete callback
 355:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****        (+) MspInitCallback                : ADC Msp Init callback
 356:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****        (+) MspDeInitCallback              : ADC Msp DeInit callback
 357:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****      [..]
 358:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c **** 
 359:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****      By default, after the HAL_ADC_Init() and when the state is HAL_ADC_STATE_RESET
 360:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****      all callbacks are set to the corresponding weak functions:
 361:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****      examples HAL_ADC_ConvCpltCallback(), HAL_ADC_ErrorCallback().
 362:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****      Exception done for MspInit and MspDeInit functions that are
 363:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****      reset to the legacy weak functions in the HAL_ADC_Init()/ HAL_ADC_DeInit() only when
 364:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****      these callbacks are null (not registered beforehand).
 365:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****     [..]
 366:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c **** 
 367:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****      If MspInit or MspDeInit are not null, the HAL_ADC_Init()/ HAL_ADC_DeInit()
 368:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****      keep and use the user MspInit/MspDeInit callbacks (registered beforehand) whatever the state.
 369:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****      [..]
 370:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c **** 
 371:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****      Callbacks can be registered/unregistered in HAL_ADC_STATE_READY state only.
