 430:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****   * @brief  Initializes the ADC peripheral and regular group according to  
 431:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****   *         parameters specified in structure "ADC_InitTypeDef".
 432:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****   * @note   As prerequisite, ADC clock must be configured at RCC top level
 433:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****   *         depending on both possible clock sources: PLL clock or AHB clock.
 434:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****   *         See commented example code below that can be copied and uncommented 
 435:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****   *         into HAL_ADC_MspInit().
 436:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****   * @note   Possibility to update parameters on the fly:
 437:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****   *         This function initializes the ADC MSP (HAL_ADC_MspInit()) only when
 438:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****   *         coming from ADC state reset. Following calls to this function can
 439:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****   *         be used to reconfigure some parameters of ADC_InitTypeDef  
 440:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****   *         structure on the fly, without modifying MSP configuration. If ADC  
 441:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****   *         MSP has to be modified again, HAL_ADC_DeInit() must be called
 442:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****   *         before HAL_ADC_Init().
 443:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****   *         The setting of these parameters is conditioned to ADC state.
 444:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****   *         For parameters constraints, see comments of structure 
 445:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****   *         "ADC_InitTypeDef".
 446:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****   * @note   This function configures the ADC within 2 scopes: scope of entire 
 447:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****   *         ADC and scope of regular group. For parameters details, see comments 
 448:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****   *         of structure "ADC_InitTypeDef".
 449:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****   * @note   For devices with several ADCs: parameters related to common ADC 
 450:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****   *         registers (ADC clock mode) are set only if all ADCs sharing the
 451:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****   *         same common group are disabled.
