 880:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c **** /**
 881:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****   * @brief  Stop ADC conversion of regular group (and injected group in 
 882:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****   *         case of auto_injection mode), disable interruption of 
 883:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****   *         end-of-conversion, disable ADC peripheral.
 884:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****   * @note:  ADC peripheral disable is forcing stop of potential 
 885:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****   *         conversion on injected group. If injected group is under use, it
 886:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****   *         should be preliminarily stopped using HAL_ADCEx_InjectedStop function.
 887:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****   * @note:  Case of multimode enabled (for devices with several ADCs): This 
 888:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****   *         function must be called for ADC master first, then ADC slave.
 889:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****   *         For ADC master, conversion is stopped and ADC is disabled. 
 890:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****   *         For ADC slave, ADC is disabled only (conversion stop of ADC master
 891:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****   *         has already stopped conversion of ADC slave).
