1074:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c **** /**
1075:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****   * @brief  Configures the the selected channel to be linked to the regular
1076:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****   *         group.
1077:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****   * @note   In case of usage of internal measurement channels:
1078:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****   *         Vbat/VrefInt/TempSensor.
1079:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****   *         The recommended sampling time is at least:
1080:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****   *          - For devices STM32F37x: 17.1us for temperature sensor
1081:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****   *          - For the other STM32F3 devices: 2.2us for each of channels 
1082:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****   *            Vbat/VrefInt/TempSensor.
1083:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****   *         These internal paths can be be disabled using function 
1084:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****   *         HAL_ADC_DeInit().
1085:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****   * @note   Possibility to update parameters on the fly:
1086:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****   *         This function initializes channel into regular group, following  
1087:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****   *         calls to this function can be used to reconfigure some parameters 
1088:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****   *         of structure "ADC_ChannelConfTypeDef" on the fly, without resetting 
