1091:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****   *         For parameters constraints, see comments of structure 
1092:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc.c ****   *         "ADC_ChannelConfTypeDef".
